<section class="wishes">
  <div class="wish-card">
    <div class="emoji">💖</div>
    <h2>For Sister</h2>
    <p>
      Dear sister, you make every moment brighter.
      May your life always be filled with happiness,
      success and beautiful memories.
    </p>
    <button onclick="copyWish(this)">Copy Wish</button>
  </div>

  <div class="wish-card">
    <div class="emoji">💙</div>
    <h2>For Brother</h2>
    <p>
      Dear brother, thank you for always being there.
      May you achieve all your dreams and always stay happy.
    </p>
    <button onclick="copyWish(this)">Copy Wish</button>
  </div>

  <div class="wish-card">
    <div class="emoji">🪷</div>
    <h2>Heartfelt Wish</h2>
    <p>
      May the sacred thread of Rakhi strengthen your bond
      and fill your lives with love, joy and countless blessings.
    </p>
    <button onclick="copyWish(this)">Copy Wish</button>
  </div>
</section>

